From b295db7ce3927263ff3fdc5a6c577774390366a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NX on Orbis <noreply@localhost>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 13:59:47 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] PS4: color lab, swapwrite= and swapview= switches to find
 (and work around) the red/blue swap

settings.txt swapwrite=a8,a2,r11,f16,depth,all exchanges red and blue in what fragment shaders
store into the chosen color targets (and in the color write mask); swapview=a8,bc,a2,r11,f16,gpu,all
exchanges them in the component mapping of the chosen sampled views. a2b10=write|sample keep
working. Everything is off by default. See ps4_color_lab.h.
---
